OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA bright
OL,6,Fevening across the region, with plenty
OL,7,Fof late evening sunshine for all,
OL,8,Falthough potentially hazy at times.
OL,9,FRemaining dry overnight with clear
OL,10,Fspells developing. Warm overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FDry, with clear or sunny
OL,13,Fspells, cloud increasing across the
OL,14,Fwest at times making skies a little
OL,15,Fhazy. Feeling very warm, and locally
OL,16,Fhot.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
