OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FSunny
OL,6,Fspells and a chance of some showers,
OL,7,Fthese locally heavy and perhaps
OL,8,Fthundery on Tuesday. Turning somewhat
OL,9,Fdrier from Wednesday, with
OL,10,Ftemperatures returning closer to
OL,11,Faverage.
